abstract: >-
  NosoGraph is an open computational map of human disease — a Python platform
  combining disease knowledge graphs, universal ontology imports, evidence
  gathering, and explainable research pipelines. Public alpha; research use
  only. Registry coverage is not equivalent to curation depth.
